WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:01.474
It's five fifty-five.

00:00:01.877 --> 00:00:03.539
Doors open in five minutes.

00:00:03.937 --> 00:00:06.080
The welcome desk has one guest list.

00:00:06.479 --> 00:00:08.154
The floor manager has another.

00:00:08.553 --> 00:00:09.665
Which one runs the room?

00:00:10.064 --> 00:00:15.778
VNV-Q is event management software
by VNV Events, powered by Ophyra.

00:00:16.176 --> 00:00:19.308
One event, one system,
one coordinated team.

00:00:19.707 --> 00:00:22.591
We set it up around the production
scope your team agrees to.

00:00:22.990 --> 00:00:27.014
We discover what matters,
design the scope, and build the system.

00:00:27.413 --> 00:00:30.531
Then we produce the event,
close, and recap.

00:00:30.929 --> 00:00:33.553
Every cue gets a time,
a place and an owner.

00:00:33.951 --> 00:00:36.932
Our producers coordinate catering, décor,

00:00:37.262 --> 00:00:39.844
multimedia, staffing and logistics.

00:00:40.242 --> 00:00:42.825
Every year,
we produce more than two hundred

00:00:42.838 --> 00:00:47.316
and fifty small and midsize events,
in addition to our corporate productions.

00:00:47.715 --> 00:00:51.039
When the doors open early,
the producer updates the schedule.

00:00:51.437 --> 00:00:53.388
The welcome desk sees the change.

00:00:53.786 --> 00:00:55.531
The floor team knows when to move.

00:00:55.929 --> 00:00:59.061
Each team member works
from the information their role needs.

00:00:59.459 --> 00:01:01.410
Guests confirm on the event page.

00:01:01.808 --> 00:01:05.476
At check-in,
staff can find a guest or their companion

00:01:05.613 --> 00:01:07.632
and validate each arrival separately.

00:01:08.031 --> 00:01:10.338
Both desks now work from the same list.

00:01:10.737 --> 00:01:14.569
For approved nonprofits,
the setup can support donations,

00:01:14.844 --> 00:01:18.621
volunteer sign-ups,
sponsorship packages and reports.

00:01:19.020 --> 00:01:22.729
The organization decides
which people can access its records.

00:01:23.127 --> 00:01:27.330
If your event needs a branded mobile app,
we'll define that scope together.

00:01:27.729 --> 00:01:30.792
Vendor onboarding
and contract tools are on the roadmap.

00:01:31.190 --> 00:01:33.306
We'll distinguish what
your team can use today.

00:01:33.704 --> 00:01:37.962
VNV-Q comes with our production
services within the agreed scope,

00:01:38.306 --> 00:01:42.701
including approved nonprofit partnerships
at no additional platform cost.

00:01:43.099 --> 00:01:44.720
Your team can use the tools again.

00:01:45.119 --> 00:01:47.110
Explore our production services.
